"Recorded %@." = "已錄下 %@。";
"%lld segment(s) did not make it into the recording." = "有 %lld 個片段沒有進到這次錄影裡。";
"The recording finished but produced no media." = "錄影結束了,但沒有產生任何影音。";
"Could not stop recording: %@" = "無法停止錄影:%@";
"%@ is not there. The recording did not reach the disk." = "%@ 不在那裡。這次錄影沒有寫到磁碟上。";
"%@ has no data in it. The recording stopped before anything was written." = "%@ 裡面沒有資料。錄影在寫入任何東西之前就停了。";
"%@ is there and its size could not be read. It says nothing about what was captured." = "%@ 在那裡,但讀不到它的大小。這不代表錄到的內容有問題。";
"%@ will not open. The recording was interrupted before it could be closed." = "%@ 打不開。錄影在能夠正常收尾之前被中斷了。";
"%@ has no picture in it. No frames reached the recorder." = "%@ 裡面沒有畫面。沒有任何影格到達錄影器。";
"%@ opens but its picture cannot be read." = "%@ 打得開,但它的畫面讀不出來。";
"%@ is much shorter than the time you recorded for. Check it before you rely on it." = "%@ 比你實際錄的時間短很多。在依賴它之前先檢查一下。";
"Opened %@. Zooms will be found from what changes on screen — there is no pointer track in an imported video." = "已開啟 %@。縮放會從畫面上的變化推得 —— 匯入的影片裡沒有指標軌。";
"Exporting %@" = "正在匯出 %@";
"Open the caption editor" = "開啟字幕編輯器";
"Captions at full width, with the waveform" = "整個視窗寬度的字幕,含波形";
"split here" = "在這裡分割";
"merge with the line above" = "與上一行合併";
"between lines" = "上下行之間";
"%lld caption(s)" = "%lld 句字幕";
"Show the whole recording" = "顯示整段錄影";
"Make captions first — the Captions section in the inspector" = "先產生字幕 —— 在 inspector 的「字幕」區";
"The pause before capture starts. It is also what hides a camera's first second, which is a dark frame settling." = "開始擷取前的等待。它同時也蓋掉鏡頭的第一秒 —— 那一秒是還在穩定的暗畫面。";
"Your files stay where they are — only the drawing stops. Turning this on restarts Finder, which closes any Finder windows you have open. The icons come back when the recording ends, and also if Soredemo is quit or crashes while one is running." = "你的檔案留在原地,只是不再被畫出來。開啟這個會重新啟動 Finder,已開啟的 Finder 視窗會被關掉。錄影結束時圖示會回來;Soredemo 在錄影中被結束或當掉時也會回來。";
"Kept out of the picture, not moved. Your Dock stays where it is and still works while you record — it is simply not in the video. Nothing on your Mac is changed, so there is nothing to put back. Recordings of a single window never include the Dock anyway." = "是不入鏡,不是被移走。你的 Dock 留在原處,錄影時照常可用 —— 它只是不在影片裡。你的 Mac 上沒有任何東西被改動,所以也沒有東西要還原。單一視窗的錄影本來就不會拍到 Dock。";
"The clock, battery, network and every icon beside them go too. Like the Dock, nothing on your Mac changes — the menu bar is still there and still works, it just is not in the recording." = "時鐘、電池、網路,以及旁邊每一個圖示都一起不入鏡。和 Dock 一樣,你的 Mac 上沒有任何東西改變 —— 選單列還在,也還能用,只是不在錄影裡。";
"The weather, the calendar and the battery ring on your desktop. They can say more than they look like they do — where you are, what is in your calendar this afternoon. Like the Dock, nothing on your Mac changes and Notification Center still opens normally while you record." = "桌面上的天氣、行事曆和電池圓環。它們說出來的事情比看起來多 —— 你在哪裡、今天下午行事曆上有什麼。和 Dock 一樣,你的 Mac 上沒有任何東西改變,錄影時通知中心也照常打得開。";
"Dragging the playhead plays the moment under it, so a sentence can be found by ear instead of by scrubbing and watching." = "拖動播放頭時會播出底下那一刻的聲音,所以一句話可以用聽的找到,而不必一邊刮一邊看。";
"Turning system audio off would leave a writer input nothing ever feeds, which costs a second and a half of every recording to recover from. It goes in when the writer can be told up front that a track will not exist." = "把系統音訊關掉,會留下一個永遠沒有東西餵它的寫入器輸入,而要從那個狀態恢復要花掉每次錄影的一秒半。它是在能夠事先告訴寫入器「這條軌不會存在」的時候才加進去的。";
"Works while another application is in front, which is when a recording is stopped." = "在其他應用程式在前景時也有效,而那正是錄影被停止的時候。";
"An export's shape, format, size and GIF settings belong to the recording being exported, under Export… in the editor. The shape is saved with the project; the rest last while that recording is open." = "匯出的形狀、格式、大小和 GIF 設定屬於被匯出的那段錄影，在編輯器的「匯出…」裡。形狀會和專案一起儲存；其餘設定在這段錄影開著的期間有效。";
"This page opens on its own whenever something Soredemo needs has not been granted, or is taken away later." = "每當 Soredemo 需要的某項權限尚未被授予、或後來被收回時,這一頁會自己打開。";
"Drop it anywhere in the list. macOS has no way for an app to add itself." = "放到清單裡任何位置都可以。macOS 沒有讓應用程式自己加進去的辦法。";
"A mosaic averages away what it covers; a solid fill leaves nothing at all. Neither is a blur — a blur can be undone." = "馬賽克把它蓋住的東西平均掉;實心填滿則什麼都不留下。兩者都不是模糊 —— 模糊是可以還原的。";
"One language per recording. A sentence that switches part-way is recognised as the chosen language throughout." = "一段錄影一種語言。中途換語言的句子,會被整句當成你選的那個語言來辨識。";
"One flat colour behind the recording. Match it to a brand, or to the slide this is going into." = "錄影後面單一一塊純色。可以配合品牌色,或是它要放進去的那張投影片。";
"Nothing behind the card, so the recording can be dropped onto a page or over another clip. Export as HEVC with Alpha — it is the smallest of the two formats that keep transparency, and ProRes 4444 is around a hundred times larger for the same picture." = "卡片後面什麼都沒有,所以這段錄影可以放到一頁上、或疊在另一段影片上。用 HEVC with Alpha 匯出 —— 在兩種保留透明度的格式裡它比較小,同樣的畫面 ProRes 4444 大約是它的一百倍。";
"An annotation is anchored to the recording, not to the frame — it moves with the picture when the camera zooms in on what it points at." = "註解錨定在錄影上,不是錨定在畫面上 —— 鏡頭推近它所指的東西時,它會跟著畫面一起走。";
"Zooms are manual here — iOS does not share where you tap. A Bluetooth mouse paired to the device gives it a cursor to follow." = "這裡的縮放是手動的 —— iOS 不會告訴外界你點了哪裡。用藍牙滑鼠配對到那台裝置,就會有一個游標可以跟。";
"Cut out on this Mac, frame by frame — around 21 ms each, so previews and exports take longer with this on." = "在這台 Mac 上一格一格摳出來 —— 每格大約 21 毫秒,所以開著它預覽和匯出都會比較久。";
"The background is transparent, so only formats that keep an alpha channel are offered. HEVC with Alpha is around a hundred times smaller than ProRes 4444 for the same picture." = "背景是透明的,所以只提供保留 alpha 通道的格式。同樣的畫面,HEVC with Alpha 大約比 ProRes 4444 小一百倍。";
"The cut only — your clips and their in-points, against the original recording, with the camera on its own lane. None of the look travels: no zooms, no cursor, no background. DaVinci Resolve reads the same file." = "只有剪接 —— 你的片段和它們的入點,對著原始錄影,鏡頭放在自己的軌道上。外觀完全不會跟過去:沒有縮放、沒有游標、沒有背景。DaVinci Resolve 讀得懂同一個檔案。";
"Nothing on the microphone track reads as speech yet, so the bed stays at its own level." = "麥克風軌上目前還沒有任何東西被判讀為語音,所以襯底音維持在它自己的音量。";
